---
title: FestiPlan - Diagramme UML de séquence - Déplacer un concert (PATCH /concerts/{id}/reschedule)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant R as Router FastAPI<br/>(concerts.py)
    participant UC as RescheduleConcert<br/>UseCase
    participant TS as TimeSlot<br/>(objet-valeur)
    participant Repo as FestivalRepository<br/>(port) / SqlAlchemy
    participant F as Festival<br/>(agrégat)
    participant NH as Notification<br/>Handler
    participant N as Notifier (port)<br/>FakeEmailNotifier
    participant DB as SQLite

    C->>R: PATCH {start_time, end_time}
    R->>R: validation du format (Pydantic)
    R->>UC: execute(RescheduleConcert)
    UC->>TS: TimeSlot(start, end)
    alt fin <= début (R1)
        TS-->>UC: RuleViolation
        UC-->>R: RuleViolation
        R-->>C: 400 Bad Request
    end

    UC->>Repo: get_by_concert_id(id)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT festival + concerts
    alt concert inconnu
        Repo-->>UC: None
        UC-->>R: NotFound
        R-->>C: 404 Not Found
    end
    Repo-->>UC: Festival (avec ses concerts)

    UC->>F: reschedule_concert(id, slot)
    F->>F: _ensure_in_preparation() (R7)
    alt planning publié
        F-->>UC: InvalidStateTransition
        UC-->>R: InvalidStateTransition
        R-->>C: 409 "planning publié"<br/>→ utiliser POST /published-reschedule
    end
    F->>F: _check_availability()<br/>R6 période · R2 scène · R3 artiste
    alt conflit ou hors festival
        F-->>UC: SchedulingConflict / RuleViolation
        UC-->>R: erreur métier
        R-->>C: 409 / 400 (rien n'est enregistré)
    end
    F->>F: concert.move_to(slot)<br/>+ enregistre ConcertRescheduled
    F-->>UC: concert

    UC->>Repo: save(festival)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE + COMMIT
    rect rgb(220, 240, 220)
        Note over UC,DB: ✅ La modification est VALIDÉE ici.<br/>Rien de ce qui suit ne peut l'annuler.
    end

    UC->>F: pull_events()
    F-->>UC: [ConcertRescheduled]
    UC->>NH: handle(events)
    NH->>N: send(sujet, message)
    alt service de notification disponible
        N-->>NH: ok
        NH-->>UC: warnings = []
    else panne (FESTIPLAN_FAIL_NOTIFICATIONS=true)
        N-->>NH: exception
        NH->>NH: log.warning(...)
        NH-->>UC: warnings = ["modification enregistrée,<br/>notification non envoyée"]
    end
    UC-->>R: OperationResult(concert, warnings)
    R-->>C: 200 OK {concert..., "warnings": [...]}
